params:path {
  id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
}

docs {
  ### Delete Proposal
  Deletes an existing job proposal. Only accessible to the applicant who submitted it.
  
  > [!IMPORTANT]
  > Before deletion, the service checks if there is an associated order. If an order exists, deletion is prevented and a `400 Bad Request` error is returned.
  
  #### Headers
  - `Authorization: Bearer <token>` (Inherited)
  
  #### Response (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "message": "Proposal deleted successfully"
    },
    "message": "Proposal deleted successfully"
  }
  ```
}
